{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 41, :comments ["<b>And his forehead is bald.</b> It has no parallel outside this section. It is an adjective. In my opinion, <i>qaraḥ</i> [baldness] is in the region of the head [crown]. He did not mention the woman because of the great moisture she has, her head will not go bald, for hair is like grass."], :book :leviticus, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 13, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["On Your Way" "http://mobile.tora.ws/"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T19:09:53.172721320Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}